      "end_s": 517.866,
      "speaker_id": "spk-B",
      "text": "It should be something new. It should do something different than just what we have."
    },
    {
      "id": "ami-is1009a-s78",
      "meeting_id": "ami-is1009a",
      "start_s": 518.122,
      "end_s": 520.896,
      "speaker_id": "spk-B",
      "text": "Now, of course, the other thing to think there is maybe the design."
    },
    {
      "id": "ami-is1009a-s79",
      "meeting_id": "ami-is1009a",
      "start_s": 521.104,
      "end_s": 524.278,
      "speaker_id": "spk-C",
      "text": "Yeah, design should be— yeah, it should be different. All the— almost all the—"
    },
    {
      "id": "ami-is1009a-s80",
      "meeting_id": "ami-is1009a",
      "start_s": 524.278,
      "end_s": 533.095,
      "speaker_id": "spk-B",
      "text": "Like trendy, you know, like earlier we saw maybe it should be something trendy, you know. Maybe different colors or materials or, you know."
    },
    {
      "id": "ami-is1009a-s81",
      "meeting_id": "ami-is1009a",
      "start_s": 534.169,
      "end_s": 538.449,
      "speaker_id": "spk-B",
      "text": "So, yeah, shapes, right? You know, like kidney-shaped feels better in your hand or something."
    },
    {
      "id": "ami-is1009a-s82",
      "meeting_id": "ami-is1009a",
      "start_s": 539.106,
      "end_s": 539.829,
      "speaker_id": "spk-A",
      "text": "Friendly shape."
    },
    {
      "id": "ami-is1009a-s83",
      "meeting_id": "ami-is1009a",
      "start_s": 540.005,
      "end_s": 540.182,
      "speaker_id": "spk-B",
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "id": "ami-is1009a-s84",
      "meeting_id": "ami-is1009a",
      "start_s": 540.631,
      "end_s": 551.163,
      "speaker_id": "spk-A",
      "text": "That would help. I think another thing that would help is if it beeps when you clap, because I think one of the big things that happens is people lose them. They can't find it."
    },
    {
      "id": "ami-is1009a-s85",
      "meeting_id": "ami-is1009a",
      "start_s": 552.592,
      "end_s": 565.26,
      "speaker_id": "spk-B",
      "text": "That is true. They put the newspaper or they put it behind a plant or, you know, whatever, and suddenly the phone rings and they want to turn the TV off and they say, where the hell is my remote control?"
    },
    {
      "id": "ami-is1009a-s86",
      "meeting_id": "ami-is1009a",
      "start_s": 565.452,
      "end_s": 573.533,
      "speaker_id": "spk-B",
      "text": "Yeah, well, or yeah, or if it's really If it's really in a dark spot, that it gives out a sound or a signal. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "id": "ami-is1009a-s87",
      "meeting_id": "ami-is1009a",
      "start_s": 573.629,
      "end_s": 576.658,
      "speaker_id": "spk-A",
      "text": "So it should either beep or a light should blink."
    },
    {
      "id": "ami-is1009a-s88",
      "meeting_id": "ami-is1009a",
      "start_s": 576.818,
      "end_s": 581.384,
      "speaker_id": "spk-B",
      "text": "If lost, signal. Throw signal, you know."
    },
    {
      "id": "ami-is1009a-s89",
      "meeting_id": "ami-is1009a",
      "start_s": 581.545,
      "end_s": 585.294,
      "speaker_id": "spk-D",
      "text": "Yeah, maybe it should have a light so that we can just recognize where it is."
    },
    {
      "id": "ami-is1009a-s90",
      "meeting_id": "ami-is1009a",
      "start_s": 585.742,
      "end_s": 592.216,
      "speaker_id": "spk-B",
      "text": "Exactly. I mean, just that's why I'm saying, I'm just saying throw signal, meaning just whether it's a beep or whether a light or a flag."
    },
    {
      "id": "ami-is1009a-s91",
      "meeting_id": "ami-is1009a",
      "start_s": 592.36,
      "end_s": 605.68,
      "speaker_id": "spk-A",
      "text": "And do you think a good clue for That is that it would respond to a clap or respond to your voice or it would respond— what should you have to do to make it beep or blink?"
    },
    {
      "id": "ami-is1009a-s92",
      "meeting_id": "ami-is1009a",
      "start_s": 605.826,
      "end_s": 625.355,
      "speaker_id": "spk-B",
      "text": "Okay, my idea is maybe that the minute it's really hidden, in other words, if it's like in a dark spot, meaning, you know, like a newspaper is on top, a sweater is on top, or it's behind a plant, at that moment it's like, what do you call it, the light sensors, you know."
    },
    {
      "id": "ami-is1009a-s93",
      "meeting_id": "ami-is1009a",
      "start_s": 625.456,
      "end_s": 626.246,
      "speaker_id": "spk-A",
      "text": "In that moment it has a sensor."
    },
    {
      "id": "ami-is1009a-s94",
      "meeting_id": "ami-is1009a",
      "start_s": 627.892,
      "end_s": 632.399,
      "speaker_id": "spk-B",
      "text": "It gets a certain darkness, it has a sensor and it gives out a signal."
    },
    {
      "id": "ami-is1009a-s95",
      "meeting_id": "ami-is1009a",
      "start_s": 632.721,
      "end_s": 637.164,
      "speaker_id": "spk-B",
      "text": "Whether that be a light signal or a beep, I mean, we can discuss that later, you know."
    },
    {
      "id": "ami-is1009a-s96",
      "meeting_id": "ami-is1009a",
      "start_s": 639.094,
      "end_s": 641.186,
      "speaker_id": "spk-A",
      "text": "So the light sensor would activate the signal?"
    },
    {
      "id": "ami-is1009a-s97",
      "meeting_id": "ami-is1009a",
      "start_s": 641.331,
      "end_s": 650.197,
      "speaker_id": "spk-B",
      "text": "That's right. You know, it would be— right, you have to have some kind of sensor. And I think voice or clapping, that's not specific enough."
    },
    {
      "id": "ami-is1009a-s98",
      "meeting_id": "ami-is1009a",
      "start_s": 651.18,
      "end_s": 657.186,
      "speaker_id": "spk-B",
      "text": "I know there are the lamps and stuff, you know, you can clap on and off. But I think they only work to a certain degree."
    },
    {
      "id": "ami-is1009a-s99",
      "meeting_id": "ami-is1009a",
      "start_s": 658.063,
      "end_s": 661.845,
      "speaker_id": "spk-A",
      "text": "But it could be someplace really obvious and you still wouldn't be able to find it."
    },
    {
      "id": "ami-is1009a-s100",
      "meeting_id": "ami-is1009a",
      "start_s": 664.3,
      "end_s": 664.8,
      "speaker_id": "spk-D",
      "text": "What, with—"
    },
