      "meeting_id": "ami-is1009a",
      "start_s": 665.284,
      "end_s": 667.703,
      "speaker_id": "spk-A",
      "text": "Well, because you're silly, because people are silly."
    },
    {
      "id": "ami-is1009a-s102",
      "meeting_id": "ami-is1009a",
      "start_s": 667.784,
      "end_s": 670.494,
      "speaker_id": "spk-B",
      "text": "Oh yeah, well, but then those people, we can't help everybody."
    },
    {
      "id": "ami-is1009a-s103",
      "meeting_id": "ami-is1009a",
      "start_s": 670.543,
      "end_s": 679.581,
      "speaker_id": "spk-A",
      "text": "Well, if it were like on top of your bookcase and you usually kept it on the coffee table, you know. Okay, we have to move along."
    },
    {
